OL,3,GNEWSAHalo HQ staff log on from new
OL,4,AWillis Building home
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe founder of a technology company
OL,7,Fsays its move to the heart of Ipswich
OL,8,Fwill help make the town a "start-up
OL,9,Fincubator" that will keep young talent
OL,10,Fin the county.
OL,12,FHalo is moving its headquarters to the
OL,13,FWillis Building - a Grade I listed
OL,14,Fglass office space designed by Lord
OL,15,FNorman Foster, with insurance firm
OL,16,FWillis - now called WTW - retaining a
OL,17,Fsmaller presence there.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,380,370,200,160,0,100
