OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAHalo HQ staff log on from new
OL,4,AWillis Building home
OL,5,
OL,6,FFounder Paul Hamilton confirmed to the
OL,7,FBBC that staff will move into the
OL,8,Fbuilding on Monday - and 250 people
OL,9,Fwill be based there by the end of the
OL,10,Fyear.
OL,12,F"This move reinstates our commitment to
OL,13,Fthe region, and ambition to make
OL,14,FIpswich a tech hub," he said, adding
OL,15,Fthat the firm wanted "to respect a
OL,16,Fhistoric and iconic building".
